cards.text:
If the number of Aristocrats you have in play is:
1 or 5: +3 Actions;
2 or 6: +3 Cards;
3 or 7: +$3;
4 or 8: +3 Buys.

Trash a card from your hand and choose one:
+1 Card per $1 it costs;
or +1 Action per $1 it costs; 
or +$1 per $1 it costs; 
or +1 Favor per $1 it costs.

If the number of cards you've gained this turn is:
2+, gain an Imp;
1, gain a card costing up to $4;
0, gain a Gold.
